       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DEFORM-GRAD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DEFORM-GRAD-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GRADIENT-INVAR-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STRESS-EQUILIB-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PLASTIC-STRAIN-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STRESS-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DEFORM-GRAD-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DEFORM-GRAD-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-GRAD-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GRAD-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GRADIENT-AND-STRESS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STRAIN-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-GRAD-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GRADIENT-AND-STRESS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GRADIENT-INVAR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STRESS-EQUILIB-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STRAIN-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PLASTIC-STRAIN-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STRESS-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-GRAD-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GRADIENT-INVAR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STRESS-EQUILIB-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PLASTIC-STRAIN-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STRESS-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DEFORM-GRAD-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-GRAD-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GRAD-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-GRAD-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GRAD-CODE.
